---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Classifier from '../components/Classifier.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/paths';
---

<Layout title="Deteksi Penyakit Daun Padi AI" includeOnnx={true}>
  <div class="space-y-10">
    <div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold bg-agro-100 text-agro-800 border border-agro-300">
          Visi Komputer Lapangan
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-soil-500 font-mono">ONNX WebAssembly &bull; Input 224×224</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-soil-900 mt-1 tracking-tight">
        Deteksi Penyakit Daun Padi Otomatis
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-soil-600 mt-1">
        Klasifikasi penyakit padi secara instan langsung di peramban Anda tanpa mengunggah data ke server luar.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The Interactive Classifier Component -->
    <Classifier />

    <!-- Practical Photography Field Guide (Clean Flat Cards) -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-soil-200 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-5">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-soil-100 pb-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-soil-900 flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="bi bi-camera-fill text-agro-700"></i>
            Panduan Pengambilan Foto Daun di Sawah
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-soil-500 mt-0.5">Tata cara pemotretan agar sensor meloloskan verifikasi lapangan</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 text-xs">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-soil-50/60 border border-soil-100/80 space-y-1.5">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-agro-100 text-agro-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">1</span>
          <strong class="text-soil-900 block text-sm">Jarak 20 - 50 cm</strong>
          <p class="text-soil-600 leading-relaxed">Pegang kamera tegak lurus dengan helai daun padi agar pola lesi atau bercak daun tertangkap tajam.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-soil-50/60 border border-soil-100/80 space-y-1.5">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-agro-100 text-agro-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">2</span>
          <strong class="text-soil-900 block text-sm">Pencahayaan Alami</strong>
          <p class="text-soil-600 leading-relaxed">Ambil foto pada pagi atau sore hari. Hindari pantulan sinar matahari menyilaukan atau bayangan tubuh pekat.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-soil-50/60 border border-soil-100/80 space-y-1.5">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-agro-100 text-agro-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">3</span>
          <strong class="text-soil-900 block text-sm">Fokus Lesi Utama</strong>
          <p class="text-soil-600 leading-relaxed">Sentuh layar HP pada titik gejala penyakit (ujung mengering, bercak belah ketupat, atau lesi oval).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-soil-50/60 border border-soil-100/80 space-y-1.5">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-agro-100 text-agro-800 font-black flex items-center justify-center text-xs">4</span>
          <strong class="text-soil-900 block text-sm">Minimal Latar Luar</strong>
          <p class="text-soil-600 leading-relaxed">Pastikan proporsi daun padi memenuhi minimal 40% area foto agar tidak tertolak sebagai foto lanskap/objek lain.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
